sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Capteur IoT
  participant SM as DeviceStateMachine
  participant MP as MqttEventPublisher
  participant D as Dashboard

  S->>SM: onTicketDetected() → READING
  loop 3 tentatives
    S->>S: Lecture QR/RFID — échec
    S->>S: retryCount++
  end
  S->>SM: onReadFailure() → ERROR
  S->>MP: publish(ERROR, retryCount=3) → festival/device/{id}/error
  MP->>D: broadcast via WebSocket
  D->>D: updateDeviceState(ERROR)
  Note over S,SM: 5 secondes d'attente
  S->>SM: onRecovery() → IDLE
  S->>MP: publish(ERROR, state=IDLE) → festival/device/{id}/status
  MP->>D: broadcast via WebSocket
  D->>D: updateDeviceState(IDLE)
